    "E2c density calibration is extensive and does not change per-m3 product or residue coefficients; facility residues reflect the E2 v1 to E2c coefficient change at fixed harvest.",
    "Assignment v10 is a node-to-facility transport-aware LP at the 119 Mm3 reference; it is not a market equilibrium or a route model for every node-facility pair.",
